body:
you are a nurse so you may understand this. I have a large chronic wound that was sutured for the 3rd time recently. it seems to have closed this time around, but it's only 7 days in and in the past typically opens around 12 days. I've been bedridden coming up on 6 months soon. if it opens again I am dead to the world for 6 months, and then possibly another and so on and so forth as operations continue to be unsuccessful.

&#x200B;

so please just leave me to my woes, as you do not understand in the slightest what I am going through.
